OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely dry
OL,6,Fto start but rain moves in from the
OL,7,Fwest. Mostly light but turning showery
OL,8,Finto the early hours. A few heavier
OL,9,Fshowers following on behind. Feeling
OL,10,Ffresher and less humid.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FIsolated, possibly heavy,
OL,13,Fshowers remain through the day, but
OL,14,Fmost places staying dry with bright
OL,15,Fand sunny spells. Temperatures around
OL,16,Faverage for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
